sequenceDiagram
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant W2 as Worker 2
    participant Q as jobs table (pending)
    W1->>Q: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 1
    Q-->>W1: row 1 (now locked)
    W2->>Q: same query
    Q-->>W2: row 2 (skips locked row 1)
    Note over W1: process job
    W1->>Q: UPDATE status = done, COMMIT
